From 23d9812ff83198ce889cedc6d3cdfc3076775f36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: veritr1x <9086448+veritr1x@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:34:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] AArch64: vector FP arithmetic, element moves, FCSEL,
 indexed STP/STR of FP registers

Adds FADD, FSUB, FMUL, FDIV, FADDP (2S, 4S, 2D), FMUL by element (vector and
scalar), INS (element), DUP (element), DUP (scalar), FCSEL (S, D), STP of Q
registers (offset, pre, post), pre/post-index STP of S and D, and pre/post-
index STR of B, H, S, D (and post-index Q). STP Q needed an MV256W type.
Each has differential tests against native execution.
